</style></head><body>
<header><div class="wrap"><div class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="DATLUME" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#fff"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" style="filter:brightness(0) invert(1)"><span style="font-size:19px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.16em">DATLUME</span></a><div class="navlinks"><a href="/procurement/">国・自治体の案件</a><a href="/realestate/">不動産・暮らし</a><a href="/regional/">都道府県別推移</a><a href="/employment-economy/">雇用・賃金</a><a href="/business-industry/">企業・産業</a><a href="/economy-prices/">経済・物価</a><a href="/energy/">エネルギー</a><a href="/about-data/">データについて</a></div></div><div class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">ECONOMY / PRICES</div><h1>経済・物価</h1><p>「どこが高い？」「何が高い？」「同じ暮らしならいくら違う？」を、47都道府県の物価データから比較。食料・住居・光熱水道などの内訳と、賃金を物価で調整した参考値まで見られます。</p><div class="hero-meta"><span>{year}年 最新結果</span><span>47都道府県</span><span>全国平均 = 100</span></div></div></div></header>
<main class="wrap"><section class="card controls"><div class="control"><label for="pref">都道府県 A</label><select id="pref">{records.map(r=><option value={r.prefecture}>{r.prefecture}</option>)}</select></div><div class="control"><label for="compare">都道府県 B</label><select id="compare"><option value="">比較なし</option>{records.map(r=><option value={r.prefecture}>{r.prefecture}</option>)}</select></div><div class="control"><label for="budget">全国平均での月間生活費</label><input id="budget" type="number" min="10000" max="1000000" step="10000" value="200000"></div></section>
<section class="kpis"><div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-label">物価水準</div><div id="kpi-overall" class="kpi-value">—</div><div id="kpi-overall-sub" class="kpi-sub">全国平均 = 100</div></div><div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-label">同じ買い物・サービスの目安</div><div id="kpi-cost" class="kpi-value">—</div><div id="kpi-cost-sub" class="kpi-sub">全国平均の生活費を換算</div></div><div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-label">最も高い費目</div><div id="kpi-high" class="kpi-value">—</div><div id="kpi-high-sub" class="kpi-sub">10大費目</div></div><div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-label">物価調整後 推計年収</div><div id="kpi-realpay" class="kpi-value">—</div><div class="kpi-sub">賃金2025年 ÷ 物価水準 × 100 / 参考値</div></div></section>
<nav class="tabs"><button class="tab" data-tab="ranking" aria-selected="true">物価ランキング</button><button class="tab" data-tab="categories" aria-selected="false">何が高い？</button><button class="tab" data-tab="simulator" aria-selected="false">生活費シミュレーター</button><button class="tab" data-tab="wage" aria-selected="false">賃金 × 物価</button><button class="tab" data-tab="history" aria-selected="false">物価推移</button></nav>
<section class="panel" data-panel="ranking"><div class="card panel-controls"><div class="control"><label for="metric">ランキング指標</label><select id="metric">{Object.entries(defs).map(([k,v])=><option value={k}>{v.label}</option>)}</select></div><div class="control"><label for="direction">並び順</label><select id="direction"><option value="high">高い順</option><option value="low">安い順</option></select></div></div><section class="grid"><div class="card chart-card"><h2 id="rank-title">物価ランキング</h2><div id="rank-sub" class="chart-sub">{year}年 / 全国平均=100</div><div id="ranking-chart" class="chart"></div></div><div class="card chart-card"><h2>選択地域の立ち位置</h2><div class="chart-sub">全国平均100からの差。0より右が全国平均より高く、左が低い。</div><div id="position-chart" class="chart"></div></div></section><section class="insights"><div class="card insight"><b>全国で最も高い</b><strong id="extreme-high">—</strong><span id="extreme-high-sub">—</span></div><div class="card insight"><b>全国で最も安い</b><strong id="extreme-low">—</strong><span id="extreme-low-sub">—</span></div><div class="card insight"><b>最大の地域差</b><strong id="extreme-gap">—</strong><span>最高値 ÷ 最低値</span></div></section></section>
<section class="panel" data-panel="categories" hidden><section class="grid"><div class="card chart-card"><h2 id="category-title">費目別の物価</h2><div class="chart-sub">全国平均=100。A/Bを同じ費目で比較。</div><div id="category-chart" class="chart"></div></div><div class="card chart-card"><h2>全国平均との差</h2><div class="chart-sub">どの費目が地域の「高い・安い」を作っているか。</div><div id="deviation-chart" class="chart"></div></div></section></section>
<section class="panel" data-panel="simulator" hidden><section class="sim-grid"><div class="card sim-card"><div class="kpi-label" id="sim-a-name">A</div><div id="sim-a-value" class="sim-value">—</div><div id="sim-a-delta" class="sim-delta">—</div><p class="note">全国平均の地域で入力額を使う生活を基準に、地域差指数で単純換算した目安です。</p></div><div class="card sim-card"><div class="kpi-label" id="sim-b-name">B</div><div id="sim-b-value" class="sim-value">—</div><div id="sim-b-delta" class="sim-delta">—</div><p class="note">家族構成・住居形態・消費内容で実際の支出は大きく変わります。</p></div></section><section class="card chart-card" style="margin-top:12px"><h2>同じ予算でどれくらい違う？</h2><div class="chart-sub">入力した全国平均での生活費を、総合指数で47都道府県へ換算。</div><div id="budget-chart" class="chart"></div></section></section>
<section class="panel" data-panel="wage" hidden><section class="grid"><div class="card chart-card"><h2>物価調整後 推計年収ランキング</h2><div class="chart-sub">推計年収 ÷ 地域物価水準 × 100。全国平均物価で見た購買力の参考値。</div><div id="realpay-chart" class="chart"></div></div><div class="card chart-card"><h2>名目年収と物価調整後</h2><div class="chart-sub">選択地域A/Bの比較。個人の年収を示すものではありません。</div><div id="paycompare-chart" class="chart"></div></div></section></section>
<section class="panel" data-panel="history" hidden><div class="card panel-controls"><div class="control"><label for="history-metric">推移指標</label><select id="history-metric"><option value="overall">総合</option><option value="food">食料</option><option value="housing">住居</option><option value="utilities">光熱・水道</option><option value="transport">交通・通信</option><option value="recreation">教養娯楽</option></select></div></div><section class="card chart-card" style="margin-top:12px"><h2>地域の物価ポジション推移</h2><div class="chart-sub">2022〜2025年 / 各年の全国平均=100。このタブを開いた時だけ履歴データを取得します。</div><div id="price-history-chart" class="chart"></div><p class="note">地域差指数なので、全国全体のインフレ率ではありません。「その年に全国平均より高いか・低いか」の変化を見る指標です。</p></section></section>
<section class="card table-card"><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:16px">47都道府県の物価一覧</h2><div class="chart-sub">生活に影響しやすい主要費目を横断比較。</div><div id="all-pref-table" class="table-wrap table-collapsed"><table><thead><tr><th>都道府県</th><th>総合</th><th>食料</th><th>住居</th><th>光熱・水道</th><th>交通・通信</th><th>教養娯楽</th><th>物価調整後年収</th></tr></thead><tbody>{records.map(r=><tr><td><a href={'/economy-prices/prefectures/'+encodeURIComponent(r.prefecture)+'/'}>{r.prefecture}</a></td><td>{fmt(r.overall)}</td><td>{fmt(r.food)}</td><td>{fmt(r.housing)}</td><td>{fmt(r.utilities)}</td><td>{fmt(r.transport)}</td><td>{fmt(r.recreation)}</td><td>{fmt((wageMap[r.prefecture]||0)*100/r.overall)}万円</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><button id="all-pref-toggle" class="table-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false">全47都道府県を見る</button></section>
<div class="quick-links">{Object.entries(defs).slice(0,8).map(([k,v])=><a href={'/economy-prices/indicators/'+k+'/'}>{v.label}ランキング →</a>)}</div>
<div class="note">出典：総務省統計局「小売物価統計調査（構造編）」{year}年結果。地域差指数は全国平均=100とした地域間の物価水準の比較で、時系列の物価上昇率を示すCPIとは異なります。「総合」と「住居」は持家の帰属家賃を含みません。「物価調整後 推計年収」は厚生労働省「賃金構造基本統計調査」の都道府県別推計年収を地域差指数で単純調整したDATLUME独自の参考値です。</div>
</main><footer><div class="wrap">出典：総務省統計局 小売物価統計調査（構造編） / 厚生労働省 賃金構造基本統計調査 · <a href="https://github.com/kkoch5t2/data-platform" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a> · <a href="https://utility-tools-jp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">無料WEB便利ツール集 ↗</a></div></footer>
<script id="economy-data" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify({records,defs,wageMap,year,extremes:data.extremes})}></script>
<script>
import * as echarts from 'echarts';
const d=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('economy-data').textContent),records=d.records,defs=d.defs,wages=d.wageMap,byName=new Map(records.map(r=>[r.prefecture,r]));const nf=new Intl.NumberFormat('ja-JP',{maximumFractionDigits:1});const yen=new Intl.NumberFormat('ja-JP',{maximumFractionDigits:0});
const pref=document.getElementById('pref'),compare=document.getElementById('compare'),budget=document.getElementById('budget'),metric=document.getElementById('metric'),direction=document.getElementById('direction'),historyMetric=document.getElementById('history-metric');const charts={};function ch(id){return charts[id]||(charts[id]=echarts.init(document.getElementById(id)))}const catKeys=['food','housing','utilities','household','clothing','medical','transport','education','recreation','misc'];
function realPay(r){return (wages[r.prefecture]||0)*100/r.overall} function signed(v){return(v>=0?'+':'')+nf.format(v)+'%'} function money(v){return yen.format(v)+'円'} function label(k){return defs[k]?.label||k}
function renderKpis(){const a=byName.get(pref.value),b=Number(budget.value)||200000;document.getElementById('kpi-overall').textContent=nf.format(a.overall);document.getElementById('kpi-overall-sub').textContent='全国平均比 '+signed(a.overall-100);document.getElementById('kpi-cost').textContent=money(b*a.overall/100);document.getElementById('kpi-cost-sub').textContent='全国平均で '+money(b)+' の生活を換算';const hi=catKeys.map(k=>[k,a[k]]).sort((x,y)=>y[1]-x[1])[0];document.getElementById('kpi-high').textContent=label(hi[0]);document.getElementById('kpi-high-sub').textContent=nf.format(hi[1])+' / 全国平均比 '+signed(hi[1]-100);document.getElementById('kpi-realpay').textContent=nf.format(realPay(a))+'万円'}
function rankingOption(k){let rows=records.map(r=>({name:r.prefecture,value:r[k]})).sort((a,b)=>direction.value==='high'?b.value-a.value:a.value-b.value).slice(0,20);return{animationDuration:300,tooltip:{trigger:'item',formatter:p=>p.name+'<br><b>'+nf.format(p.value)+'</b><br>全国平均比 '+signed(p.value-100)},grid:{left:82,right:72,top:10,bottom:22},xAxis:{type:'value',min:Math.min(90,Math.floor(Math.min(...rows.map(x=>x.value))-1)),axisLabel:{fontSize:9},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#eef2f6'}}},yAxis:{type:'category',inverse:true,data:rows.map(x=>x.name),axisTick:{show:false},axisLine:{show:false},axisLabel:{fontSize:10}},series:[{type:'bar',barWidth:12,data:rows.map(x=>x.value),label:{show:true,position:'right',fontSize:9,fontWeight:700,formatter:p=>nf.format(p.value)},itemStyle:{borderRadius:[0,7,7,0]},markLine:{silent:true,symbol:'none',lineStyle:{type:'dashed',color:'#98a2b3'},data:[{xAxis:100}]}}]}}
function renderRanking(){const k=metric.value,a=byName.get(pref.value),b=compare.value?byName.get(compare.value):null;document.getElementById('rank-title').textContent=label(k)+' '+(direction.value==='high'?'高い':'安い')+'都道府県';ch('ranking-chart').setOption(rankingOption(k),true);const keys=['overall','food','housing','utilities','transport','recreation'],series=[{name:'A · '+a.prefecture,type:'bar',data:keys.map(x=>a[x]-100),itemStyle:{color:'#1769e0'}}];if(b)series.push({name:'B · '+b.prefecture,type:'bar',data:keys.map(x=>b[x]-100),itemStyle:{color:'#087f5b'}});ch('position-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>signed(v)},legend:{top:0},grid:{left:82,right:30,top:42,bottom:20},xAxis:{type:'value',axisLabel:{formatter:v=>(v>0?'+':'')+v+'%'},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#eef2f6'}}},yAxis:{type:'category',inverse:true,data:keys.map(label)},series},true);const ex=d.extremes[k];document.getElementById('extreme-high').textContent=ex.max.prefecture;document.getElementById('extreme-high-sub').textContent=nf.format(ex.max.value)+' / 全国平均比 '+signed(ex.max.value-100);document.getElementById('extreme-low').textContent=ex.min.prefecture;document.getElementById('extreme-low-sub').textContent=nf.format(ex.min.value)+' / 全国平均比 '+signed(ex.min.value-100);document.getElementById('extreme-gap').textContent=nf.format(ex.max.value/ex.min.value)+'倍'}
function renderCategories(){const a=byName.get(pref.value),b=compare.value?byName.get(compare.value):null,series=[{name:'A · '+a.prefecture,type:'bar',barWidth:14,data:catKeys.map(k=>a[k]),itemStyle:{color:'#1769e0',borderRadius:[0,7,7,0]}}];if(b)series.push({name:'B · '+b.prefecture,type:'bar',barWidth:14,data:catKeys.map(k=>b[k]),itemStyle:{color:'#087f5b',borderRadius:[0,7,7,0]}});document.getElementById('category-title').textContent=b?a.prefecture+' × '+b.prefecture+' 費目比較':a.prefecture+' 何が高い？';ch('category-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'axis'},legend:{top:0},grid:{left:106,right:38,top:42,bottom:22},xAxis:{type:'value',min:75,max:135,splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#eef2f6'}}},yAxis:{type:'category',inverse:true,data:catKeys.map(label),axisLabel:{fontSize:10}},series:series.map(s=>({...s,markLine:{silent:true,symbol:'none',lineStyle:{type:'dashed',color:'#98a2b3'},data:[{xAxis:100}]}}))},true);const dev=[{name:'A · '+a.prefecture,type:'bar',data:catKeys.map(k=>a[k]-100),itemStyle:{color:'#1769e0'}}];if(b)dev.push({name:'B · '+b.prefecture,type:'bar',data:catKeys.map(k=>b[k]-100),itemStyle:{color:'#087f5b'}});ch('deviation-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>signed(v)},legend:{top:0},grid:{left:106,right:30,top:42,bottom:22},xAxis:{type:'value',axisLabel:{formatter:v=>(v>0?'+':'')+v+'%'},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#eef2f6'}}},yAxis:{type:'category',inverse:true,data:catKeys.map(label),axisLabel:{fontSize:10}},series:dev},true)}
function renderSimulator(){const a=byName.get(pref.value),b=compare.value?byName.get(compare.value):null,base=Math.max(10000,Number(budget.value)||200000),costA=base*a.overall/100,costB=b?base*b.overall/100:null;document.getElementById('sim-a-name').textContent='A · '+a.prefecture;document.getElementById('sim-a-value').textContent=money(costA);document.getElementById('sim-a-delta').textContent='全国平均より '+(costA>=base?'+':'')+money(costA-base);document.getElementById('sim-b-name').textContent=b?'B · '+b.prefecture:'B · 比較なし';document.getElementById('sim-b-value').textContent=b?money(costB):'—';document.getElementById('sim-b-delta').textContent=b?'Aとの差 '+(costB-costA>=0?'+':'')+money(costB-costA):'都道府県Bを選択';const rows=records.map(r=>({name:r.prefecture,value:Math.round(base*r.overall/100)})).sort((x,y)=>x.value-y.value);ch('budget-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'item',formatter:p=>p.name+'<br><b>'+money(p.value)+'</b>'},grid:{left:82,right:92,top:12,bottom:22},xAxis:{type:'value',min:'dataMin',axisLabel:{formatter:v=>Math.round(v/10000)+'万'}},yAxis:{type:'category',inverse:true,data:rows.map(x=>x.name),axisLabel:{fontSize:9}},series:[{type:'bar',barWidth:8,data:rows.map(x=>x.value),label:{show:true,position:'right',fontSize:8,formatter:p=>Math.round(p.value/1000)/10+'万'},itemStyle:{borderRadius:[0,5,5,0]}}]},true)}
function renderWage(){const rows=records.map(r=>({name:r.prefecture,value:realPay(r),nominal:wages[r.prefecture]||0})).sort((a,b)=>b.value-a.value).slice(0,20);ch('realpay-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'item',formatter:p=>p.name+'<br>物価調整後 <b>'+nf.format(p.value)+'万円</b><br>名目 '+nf.format(p.data.nominal)+'万円'},grid:{left:82,right:88,top:10,bottom:22},xAxis:{type:'value',show:false},yAxis:{type:'category',inverse:true,data:rows.map(x=>x.name),axisLabel:{fontSize:10}},series:[{type:'bar',barWidth:12,data:rows.map(x=>({value:x.value,nominal:x.nominal})),label:{show:true,position:'right',fontSize:9,formatter:p=>nf.format(p.value)+'万'},itemStyle:{borderRadius:[0,7,7,0]}}]},true);const a=byName.get(pref.value),b=compare.value?byName.get(compare.value):null,names=[a.prefecture],nominal=[wages[a.prefecture]||0],adjusted=[realPay(a)];if(b){names.push(b.prefecture);nominal.push(wages[b.prefecture]||0);adjusted.push(realPay(b))}ch('paycompare-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>nf.format(v)+'万円'},legend:{top:0},grid:{left:64,right:20,top:42,bottom:42},xAxis:{type:'category',data:names},yAxis:{type:'value',axisLabel:{formatter:v=>nf.format(v)+'万'}},series:[{name:'名目推計年収',type:'bar',data:nominal},{name:'物価調整後',type:'bar',data:adjusted}]},true)}
let priceHistoryData=null;async function renderHistory(){if(!priceHistoryData){try{const r=await fetch('/data/economy-prices-history.json');if(!r.ok)throw new Error('fetch');priceHistoryData=await r.json()}catch(e){ch('price-history-chart').clear();return}}const key=historyMetric.value;const snapMap=new Map(priceHistoryData.snapshots.map(s=>[s.year,new Map(s.records.map(r=>[r.prefecture,r]))]));const mk=name=>({name,type:'line',smooth:.16,symbolSize:8,lineStyle:{width:3},data:priceHistoryData.years.map(y=>snapMap.get(y)?.get(name)?.[key]??null)});const series=[mk(pref.value)];if(compare.value)series.push(mk(compare.value));ch('price-history-chart').setOption({tooltip:{trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>nf.format(v)},legend:{top:0},grid:{left:58,right:24,top:44,bottom:38},xAxis:{type:'category',data:priceHistoryData.years},yAxis:{type:'value',scale:true,axisLabel:{formatter:v=>nf.format(v)},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#eef2f6'}}},series:series.map(x=>({...x,markLine:{silent:true,symbol:'none',lineStyle:{type:'dashed',color:'#98a2b3'},data:[{yAxis:100}]}}))},true)}
const renderers={ranking:renderRanking,categories:renderCategories,simulator:renderSimulator,wage:renderWage,history:renderHistory};let active='ranking';
function renderAll(){renderKpis();renderers[active]();syncUrl()}
function setTab(tab,sync=true){if(!renderers[tab])tab='ranking';active=tab;document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(x.dataset.tab===tab)));document.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(x=>x.hidden=x.dataset.panel!==tab);requestAnimationFrame(()=>{renderKpis();renderers[tab]();Object.values(charts).forEach(x=>x.resize())});if(sync)syncUrl()}
function syncUrl(){const q=new URLSearchParams({pref:pref.value,tab:active,metric:metric.value,order:direction.value,budget:String(Number(budget.value)||200000)});if(active==='history')q.set('historyMetric',historyMetric.value);if(compare.value)q.set('compare',compare.value);history.replaceState(null,'','?'+q.toString())}
function restore(){const q=new URLSearchParams(location.search);if(!q.get('pref')&&[...pref.options].some(o=>o.value==='東京都'))pref.value='東京都';for(const [el,k] of [[pref,'pref'],[compare,'compare'],[metric,'metric'],[direction,'order']]){const v=q.get(k);if(v&&[...el.options].some(o=>o.value===v))el.value=v}const hm=q.get('historyMetric');if(hm&&[...historyMetric.options].some(o=>o.value===hm))historyMetric.value=hm;const b=q.get('budget');if(b&&Number.isFinite(Number(b)))budget.value=b;active=q.get('tab')||'ranking'}
const allPrefTable=document.getElementById('all-pref-table'),allPrefToggle=document.getElementById('all-pref-toggle');allPrefToggle?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const collapsed=allPrefTable.classList.toggle('table-collapsed');allPrefToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!collapsed));allPrefToggle.textContent=collapsed?'全47都道府県を見る':'15件表示に戻す'});
function normalizeComparison(){if(compare.value&&compare.value===pref.value)compare.value=''}restore();normalizeComparison();document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('click',()=>setTab(x.dataset.tab)));[pref,compare,metric,direction].forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('change',()=>{normalizeComparison();renderAll()}));historyMetric.addEventListener('change',()=>{if(active==='history'){renderHistory();syncUrl()}});budget.addEventListener('input',()=>{renderKpis();if(active==='simulator')renderSimulator();syncUrl()});setTab(active,false);window.addEventListener('resize',()=>Object.values(charts).forEach(x=>x.resize()));
</script></body></html>
